meta-mokhles
============

My first Yocto layer (Yocto Project 6.0 "Wrynose").

Contents:
- mokhles-image: minimal Linux image with CAN support and my own programs
- packagegroup-mokhles-can: CAN tools, vcan driver, startup script, sender and receiver
- linux-yocto bbappend: enables CAN in the kernel (can.cfg)
- can-sender / can-receiver: C programs using SocketCAN on vcan0
- can-setup: init script that creates vcan0 at boot

Build:
    bitbake mokhles-image

Run:
    runqemu mokhles-image nographic slirp snapshot

Depends on: openembedded-core, meta-o
